mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171060/extras/b5ca6aabddebc758413b045953efa06e.poster.avif?t=1709861004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171060/extras/b5ca6aabddebc758413b045953efa06e.webm?t=1709861004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171060/extras/b5ca6aabddebc758413b045953efa06e.mp4?t=1709861004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Multiple choices for skill system building: Bullet Time, Gravity Bomb, Laser Gun etc..<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiple Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Vanquishing huge planet mechanical boss.<br></li><li> Wiping out the space base of enemies.<br></li><li> Surviving from the mechanical frenzy within limited time.<br></li><li> 1v1 Defeating the monsters who can mirror the human skills.<br></li><li> More excitings are coming soon....<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171060/extras/c52eba6a7817495a799738166a6d50ff.poster.avif?t=1709861004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171060/extras/c52eba6a7817495a799738166a6d50ff.webm?t=1709861004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171060/extras/c52eba6a7817495a799738166a6d50ff.mp4?t=1709861004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><a href=\"mailto:MAIL\uff1aspecial@xrlinkup.com\">MAIL\uff1aspecial@xrlinkup.com</a></li></ul></li></ul>",
